{
  "$defs": {
    "AppliedChange": {
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "description": "已经物化进档案的一条变更，**带撤销把手**。\n\n与 :class:`ProfileChangeEvent` 分工不同：那个是 append-only 的**事件**\n（所以是 FrozenModel，一个 id 永远只指一件事）；这个是**台账行**，\n有生命周期——已应用 → 已撤销。撤销不删行，只盖 ``undone_at``，\n因为\"这条后来被撤了\"本身就是审计要回答的问题。\n\n刻意不做成 FrozenModel：把有状态的台账伪装成不可变事件，只会逼出\n``model_copy(update=...)`` 那种绕过守卫的写法。",
      "properties": {
        "applied_at": {
          "format": "date-time",
          "title": "Applied At",
          "type": "string"
        },
        "change_id": {
          "maxLength": 128,
          "minLength": 1,
          "title": "Change Id",
          "type": "string"
        },
        "entity_type": {
          "enum": [
            "experience",
            "skill",
            "education",
            "language",
            "honor",
            "certificate"
          ],
          "title": "Entity Type",
          "type": "string"
        },
        "origin": {
          "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ProfileWriteOrigin"
        },
        "proposal_id": {
          "anyOf": [
            {
              "maxLength": 128,
              "minLength": 1,
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "type": "null"
            }
          ],
          "default": null,
          "title": "Proposal Id"
        },
        "student_id": {
          "maxLength": 128,
          "minLength": 1,
          "title": "Student Id",
          "type": "string"
        },
        "summary": {
          "maxLength": 300,
          "minLength": 1,
          "title": "Summary",
          "type": "string"
        },
        "undone_at": {
          "anyOf": [
            {
              "format": "date-time",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "type": "null"
            }
          ],
          "default": null,
          "title": "Undone At"
        }
      },
      "required": [
        "change_id",
        "student_id",
        "origin",
        "entity_type",
        "summary",
        "applied_at"
      ],
      "title": "AppliedChange",
      "type": "object"
    },
    "ProfileWriteOrigin": {
      "description": "一次 Profile 写入的来路。B3 约束的是最后一种。\n\nSpec §5.6 / §17.5 的 ``Unconfirmed Profile Write`` 管的是\"**AI 抽取或\n高影响推断**被静默写进档案\"。学生本人自助编辑（``selfEditProfile``）\n从来就是直写的，学生本人上传官方模板经**确定性解析**得到的自述内容\n与之同类——两者都是学生自己说的话，不是系统替他下的结论。",
      "enum": [
        "student_upload",
        "student_edit",
        "agent_proposal"
      ],
      "title": "ProfileWriteOrigin",
      "type": "string"
    }
  },
  "$id": "https://campuspath.invalid/schema/ResumeUploadResult.json",
  "additionalProperties": false,
  "description": "上传官方模板简历的结果：**已经写进档案了**，不是待办清单。\n\n2026-08-10 用户裁定：上传后绕到\"档案更新建议\"分页逐条按确认很多余。\n改为直写 + 弹窗逐条回显 + 每条可撤销。\n\n``skipped`` 是如实交代——档案里已有的条目不重复写入，但也不能装作\n没解析到；否则学生会以为模板没写对。",
  "properties": {
    "applied": {
      "default": [],
      "items": {
        "$ref": "#/components/schemas/AppliedChange"
      },
      "title": "Applied",
      "type": "array"
    },
    "profile_version": {
      "minimum": 1,
      "title": "Profile Version",
      "type": "integer"
    },
    "proposal_id": {
      "maxLength": 128,
      "minLength": 1,
      "title": "Proposal Id",
      "type": "string"
    },
    "skipped": {
      "default": [],
      "items": {
        "type": "string"
      },
      "title": "Skipped",
      "type": "array"
    },
    "student_id": {
      "maxLength": 128,
      "minLength": 1,
      "title": "Student Id",
      "type": "string"
    }
  },
  "required": [
    "proposal_id",
    "student_id",
    "profile_version"
  ],
  "title": "ResumeUploadResult",
  "type": "object"
}
